{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5293447655006245011,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What Happens During exec()",
      "source_hash": 18385112511375018100,
      "context_hash": 4910597807265300412,
      "translation": "exec() 중에 일어나는 일",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146729Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "From execve() syscall to a running new process",
      "source_hash": 9063611318961952402,
      "context_hash": 16739697690292631267,
      "translation": "execve() 시스템 콜부터 새 프로세스 실행까지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146730Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Overview",
      "source_hash": 11777448466030057203,
      "context_hash": 12521308259998440782,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146731Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`execve()` replaces the current process image with a new one.",
      "source_hash": 290285045843137034,
      "context_hash": 17244137035898676046,
      "translation": "`execve()`는 현재 프로세스 이미지를 새 이미지로 교체합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146731Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The PID stays the same, but the address space, file descriptors (non-`O_CLOEXEC`), and registers are replaced:",
      "source_hash": 8821795955658056681,
      "context_hash": 10562911860772274113,
      "translation": "PID는 그대로 유지되지만, 주소 공간, 파일 디스크립터(`O_CLOEXEC`가 아닌 것), 레지스터는 교체됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address space": "주소 공간",
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146731Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The linux_binprm structure",
      "source_hash": 765052393575354465,
      "context_hash": 13345174271131058309,
      "translation": "linux_binprm 구조체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146731Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: syscall entry",
      "source_hash": 1665504925974263076,
      "context_hash": 5756037770550020939,
      "translation": "1단계: 시스템 콜 진입",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall entry": "시스템 콜 진입"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146731Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: binary format detection",
      "source_hash": 17982197797757183616,
      "context_hash": 15722131117249824916,
      "translation": "2단계: 바이너리 형식 감지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146731Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For `#!/bin/sh` scripts, `binfmt_script` re-invokes `search_binary_handler` with `/bin/sh` as the new executable.",
      "source_hash": 17634618510169394949,
      "context_hash": 1610921943375270007,
      "translation": "`#!/bin/sh` 스크립트의 경우, `binfmt_script`는 `/bin/sh`를 새 실행 파일로 하여 `search_binary_handler`를 다시 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3: ELF loading",
      "source_hash": 9187481431655493500,
      "context_hash": 8455009829970207352,
      "translation": "3단계: ELF 로딩",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ELF": "ELF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The resulting address space",
      "source_hash": 5623462625396093695,
      "context_hash": 1128815070355896690,
      "translation": "결과로 만들어지는 주소 공간",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address space": "주소 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "After exec completes, `/proc/<pid>/maps` shows:",
      "source_hash": 17899121383582271979,
      "context_hash": 14019152525084790680,
      "translation": "exec가 완료되면 `/proc/<pid>/maps`는 다음과 같이 표시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Dynamic linker startup",
      "source_hash": 1255483810877924975,
      "context_hash": 6053226380675008210,
      "translation": "동적 링커 시작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel jumps to `ld.so`'s entry point, not the main binary's. `ld.so`:",
      "source_hash": 1163959043582447548,
      "context_hash": 1591122028092526302,
      "translation": "커널은 메인 바이너리의 진입점이 아니라 `ld.so`의 진입점으로 점프합니다. `ld.so`는 다음을 수행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "entry point": "진입점",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Maps itself (it's position-independent)",
      "source_hash": 7646355767255817803,
      "context_hash": 15321742800081316904,
      "translation": "자기 자신을 매핑(위치 독립적이므로)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Reads the binary's `PT_DYNAMIC` segment to find shared library dependencies",
      "source_hash": 8402154463214119325,
      "context_hash": 14419900074933895079,
      "translation": "바이너리의 `PT_DYNAMIC` 세그먼트를 읽어 공유 라이브러리 의존성 파악",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Loads each `.so` via `mmap()` (creating new VMAs)",
      "source_hash": 12459316604495864624,
      "context_hash": 4104695040627714759,
      "translation": "각 `.so`를 `mmap()`으로 로드(새 VMA 생성)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VMA": "VMA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Resolves PLT/GOT relocations (symbol addresses)",
      "source_hash": 12901323804336658255,
      "context_hash": 4992441149538244697,
      "translation": "PLT/GOT 재배치(심볼 주소) 해석",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "addresses": "주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Calls `DT_INIT` constructors (e.g., `__attribute__((constructor))` functions)",
      "source_hash": 6399333577123296689,
      "context_hash": 11386808327706633227,
      "translation": "`DT_INIT` 생성자 호출(예: `__attribute__((constructor))` 함수)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "functions": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Jumps to the main binary's `e_entry` (the `_start` symbol)",
      "source_hash": 8942269769392690813,
      "context_hash": 1534417482931759746,
      "translation": "메인 바이너리의 `e_entry`(`_start` 심볼)로 점프",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "begin_new_exec: the point of no return",
      "source_hash": 3194976535013679308,
      "context_hash": 2809968291314317589,
      "translation": "begin_new_exec: 돌아올 수 없는 지점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "exec and threads",
      "source_hash": 6251447107879738704,
      "context_hash": 3992584068724709710,
      "translation": "exec와 스레드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If the calling process has multiple threads, `execve` kills all other threads before replacing the address space:",
      "source_hash": 9426003668104624376,
      "context_hash": 2497082660380592633,
      "translation": "호출한 프로세스에 스레드가 여러 개 있으면, `execve`는 주소 공간을 교체하기 전에 다른 모든 스레드를 종료합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address space": "주소 공간",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing exec",
      "source_hash": 16980294451284333472,
      "context_hash": 17436250456124314294,
      "translation": "exec 관찰하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:11:40.146733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
